if is a draft, it doesn't appear on our main page, if you publish it does

private vs public.... public literally anyone in the world (or following a bit unclear) can see the article, private, you can set what groups can see it (so like I could set it so mods can see this spell but not players)

WIP vs done - not exactly sure... i thought WIP kept it from appearing on the page, but not positive other than maybe its just a marker for you to know where it is at
